WEBVTT

00:10:58.236 --> 00:11:01.916
However, the retina
eventually gets overwhelmed.

00:11:01.956 --> 00:11:04.356
Tragically, our heroes
can no longer keep fighting

00:11:04.356 --> 00:11:05.636
and start dying off

00:11:05.676 --> 00:11:08.276
to the point where they are
completely absent.

00:11:08.276 --> 00:11:11.276
Exactly like we see in those AMD patients.

00:11:12.076 --> 00:11:13.436
The enemies keep coming.

00:11:13.436 --> 00:11:17.636
124, though, no more, missing in action.

00:11:17.676 --> 00:11:19.836
And as a consequence, our retina suffers.

00:11:19.876 --> 00:11:22.356
Our vision suffers.

00:11:23.796 --> 00:11:26.316
So in a study we published last year,

00:11:26.316 --> 00:11:31.036
we supplemented 124 to animals
that have undergone retinal damage.